# Agent docs that describe THIS deployment rather than the software: private IPs, VM
# inventory, ssh aliases, per-host runbooks, and one point-in-time validation report.
# Untracked on purpose — the public snapshot is `git archive`, so untracked never ships.
# Anything internal that must stay IN the repo goes in scripts/security/internal-paths.txt
# instead (tracked, stripped only at publish) — e.g. docs/agent/release/.
docs/agent/infra/
docs/agent/TROUBLESHOOT.md
docs/agent/devices/EMULATOR.md
docs/agent/devices/ANDROID_EMULATOR_TROUBLESHOOT.md
